# already-tracked file. Both lines are required: `docs/*` excludes the
# docs/infrastructure/ DIRECTORY itself, and git cannot re-include files
# beneath an excluded directory. The directory negation lets git descend;
# `**` re-includes the contents.
!docs/infrastructure/
!docs/infrastructure/**
